-- 作品资产与运行状态存储引擎这个盒子：定稿章节手稿、随正文保存的终审节拍与伏笔确认、派生状态结案记录与手改同步记录。
-- 只写每个端口在数据上的前后条件；两阶段提交、崩溃恢复与手改同步之间的先后由 design/behavior 持有。
-- 精度停在“正文与确认同批落盘、派生状态重用已保存确认结案、未结案章节禁止手改同步代结账”：正文文本、角色字段与检索打分保持不透明。
module narrateos_hostService_bookStore
exports
  types
    ChapterId; Confirmation; struct Settlement
  operations
    commitManuscript : ChapterId * Confirmation ==> ();
    settleDerivedState : ChapterId * Confirmation * Settlement ==> ();
    syncEditedManuscript : ChapterId ==> ()
definitions
types
  ChapterId = token;
  Confirmation = token;
  -- 章节派生状态与节拍伏笔核销的结案方式：当轮正常推进完成，或崩溃重启后重用已保存确认恢复完成。
  Settlement = <Normal> | <Recovered>;

-- REQ-2
-- REQ-9
-- REQ-10
-- 已定稿落盘的章节手稿、随正文保存的终审节拍伏笔确认、已完成派生状态结案的章节与已完成手改同步的章节。
state Ledger of
  manuscripts   : set of ChapterId
  confirmations : map ChapterId to Confirmation
  settled       : map ChapterId to Settlement
  synced        : set of ChapterId
inv mk_Ledger(ms, cfs, stl, sy) ==
  dom cfs = ms and dom stl subset ms and sy subset dom stl
init s == s = mk_Ledger({}, {|->}, {|->}, {})
end

operations
  -- REQ-2
  -- REQ-9
  -- 阶段一原子提交：在无未结案半章时归档定稿正文，并同批持久化终审确认的节拍与伏笔；每章正文至多定稿落盘一次。
  commitManuscript(ch : ChapterId, cf : Confirmation)
  ext rd settled
      wr manuscripts, confirmations
  pre ch not in set manuscripts and manuscripts = dom settled
  post manuscripts = manuscripts~ union {ch} and
       confirmations = confirmations~ munion {ch |-> cf};

  -- REQ-2
  -- REQ-9
  -- 阶段二原子提交：重用随该章正文保存的终审确认提交派生状态与节拍伏笔核销；每章派生状态至多结案一次。
  settleDerivedState(ch : ChapterId, cf : Confirmation, mode : Settlement)
  ext rd manuscripts, confirmations
      wr settled
  pre ch in set manuscripts and ch not in set dom settled and
      confirmations(ch) = cf
  post settled = settled~ munion {ch |-> mode};

  -- REQ-6
  -- REQ-10
  -- 创作者手改增量同步：仅在目标章节已结案且不存在未完成派生状态结案的半章时受理，禁止以同步代为结账。
  syncEditedManuscript(ch : ChapterId)
  ext rd manuscripts, settled
      wr synced
  pre ch in set dom settled and manuscripts = dom settled
  post synced = synced~ union {ch};

end narrateos_hostService_bookStore
